    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to bring 'Swallow Hill' Doonass to the market. Perched on an elevated site of approx. 0.9 acres with sweeping views over the rolling Clare countryside and as far as Limerick City, this newly built A-rated family home offers the perfect blend of rural tranquility, modern luxury, and everyday functionality. The property was originally built in 2009 but only recently finished and completed to the highest standards.\n\nThis is a turnkey property, immaculately finished inside and out, ready for immediate occupation. Designed with both family living and entertaining in mind, this home delivers style, comfort, and sustainability in equal measure. The property is currently furnished with great style and taste which will further elevate the viewing experience and this furniture is available to purchase separately should the new buyer wish.\n\nThe property is approached via private driveway and the quality and unique features of this home become apparent quickly. The colour palate and quality finishes both externally and internally will appeal to those searching for a family home which is ideal for both informal family life and more formal entertaining.\n\nAt ground floor a welcoming entrance hallway opens into a large dual aspect living room with fitted stove. The beautifully fitted kitchen/dining room with doors t the garden opens into a fully fitted boot room/utility and a guest w.c. There are three double bedroom at his level, two of which have walk in wardrobes and ensuite facilities. The third bedroom has a walk in wardrobe and access to the family bathroom.\nAt first floor level there is a magnificent master suite with very large and impressive dressing room and ensuite. There are two further double bedrooms also ideal for use as home office or games room a bathroom and additional storage. The upstairs rooms are positioned to maximise the magnificent views that 'Swallow Hill' enjoys.\n\nLocated just a short drive from Limerick City, with local schools, shops, and amenities nearby, this home offers the best of both worlds — a peaceful country setting with easy access to urban conveniences including a primary school a creche and community hall. Castleconnell can also be reached on foot via the footbridge which is only minutes from the property.\n\nServices: \nAir to water heatpump.\nBiocycle unit.\nWell and treatment water softener and UV treatment.\nFibre broadband to the gate of the property.\n\nAccommodation: Hall, living room, kitchen/dining room, 5/6 bedrooms, 3 with dressing rooms and ensuite facilities, 3 / 4 reception rooms, 2 family bathrooms. Guest W.C. utility room."
      },
